      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} if AudioSource's spatial audio in Unity is set to 2D rather than 3D, then it would play for everyone as long as the avatar is loaded for them, and Vrchat SDK doesn't regulate it whatsoever. Think that's what the OP is describing?",
